    (20, 5623, N'Market Leader 3Rd Edition Intermediate Practice File Cd Pack', N'NXB Thế giới', 212000.00, N'The 3rd edition Course Book includes: * All new reading texts from the Financial Times * All new case studies with opinions from successful consultants who work in the real world of business * All new listening texts reflecting the global nature of business * New ''Business Across Cultures'' spreads * New Vocabulary Trainer www.marketleader.vocabtrainer.net', '2017-01-15', N'https://cdn1.fahasa.com/media/catalog/product/i/m/image_195509_1_20461.jpg', 50),
    (21, 5624, N'Market Leader 3Rd Edition Upper Intermediate Practice File & Practice File Cd Pack', N'NXB Lao Động', 174000.00, N'The 3rd edition Course Book includes: * All new reading texts from the Financial Times * All new case studies with opinions from successful consultants who work in the real world of business * All new listening texts reflecting the global nature of business * New ''Business Across Cultures'' spreads * New Vocabulary Trainer www.marketleader.vocabtrainer.net', '2018-10-13', N'https://cdn1.fahasa.com/media/catalog/product/i/m/image_195509_1_20462.jpg', 50),
